  "round_trip": "Actual git apply and reverse with whitespace validation, exact bytes and 100644 mode in both directions on exact stock files.",
  "source_audit": [
    "The tracked codex_models audit returned only workspace, chats/codex, workspace/startup and workspace/windows paths, all at the exact base.",
    "One constructor call in chats/codex moves the workspace snapshot into Chat::new_codex; all model/effort picker expressions already borrow or shallow clone the existing binding Arc.",
    "Boot restore calls models() once for its set of successful resumed/opened views. The cache in CodexService still owns a separate Vec. Successful new/resume handlers still get their own returned Vec and install a new workspace snapshot with the existing guards and ordering.",
    "Detached window catalog capture and assignment are byte-identical. Native window creation, guard checks and existing Chat entity adoption keep the old binding unchanged."
  ],
